(Total T<>D input for the month of May 2024, as metered, is 1275.23 MU. Out of which, change-over) Tj
T* (sales of 147.01 MU has been subtracted. Thus, against the total metered T<>D input of 1275.23 MU) Tj
T* (for the month of May 2024, for the purpose of distribution loss computation for FAC, T<>D input to be) Tj
T* (considered as pertaining to AEML-D consumers, is 1100.07 MU. Sales considered for the purpose of) Tj
T* (distribution loss computation are 1005.3 MU \(this is after netting off GCN credit for OA consumption\).) Tj
T* (Accordingly, Distribution Loss for the month of May 2024 works out to 8.62% vs the approved target of) Tj
T* (6.55%. The Hon’ble Commission, in the MYT Order dated 30-03-2020 in Case No. 325 of 2019, had) Tj
T* (approved the distribution loss at 6.55% for FY 2024-25. The Hon’ble Commission, in the MTR Order) Tj
T* (in Case No. 231 of 2022, has retained the distribution loss target at 6.55% for FY 2024-25 as) Tj
T* (approved in the MYT Order.) Tj
