T* (in this case, is within 7 days of the invoice date. Hence DSPPL energy bill for the month of June 2020) Tj
T* (will be booked in June 2020 and will be considered in FAC workings of June 2020, while the rebate) Tj
T* (will be considered in July 2020 based on actual payment date \(rebate availed date\).) Tj
